{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track is filled with genuine emotion and depth, from melancholy tunes to energetic rhythms, allowing you to experience the culture and traditions of the locals. This soundtrack doesn't just accompany the gameplay, it becomes an integral part of the narrative, enriching each scene and emphasizing the unique moments of the adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heart of Altai is not only a game, but also a special musical experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main song of the album was written by game designer Danila Ermakov, who is also the composer of the project. Famous Altai throat singing master Dobrynya Satin, guitarist of metal band S.C.A.R.D. Evgeny Rudenko, Altai singer Galina Tolkochekova and ILLIDIANCE drummer Anton Brezhnev took part in the recording.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814450?t=1750755070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814450?t=1750755070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814450/39bfccfeff1f5c25cdf234130c64c4f5246ad5df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750755070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814450/39bfccfeff1f5c25cdf234130c64c4f5246ad5df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750755070","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track is filled with genuine emotion and depth, from melancholy tunes to energetic rhythms, allowing you to experience the culture and traditions of the locals. This soundtrack doesn't just accompany the gameplay, it becomes an integral part of the narrative, enriching each scene and emphasizing the unique moments of the adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heart of Altai is not only a game, but also a special musical experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main song of the album was written by game desig